# =============================================================================
# CODEOWNERS - Automatic Review Assignment
# =============================================================================
# This file defines code ownership for automatic PR review requests.
# Owners are automatically requested for review when someone opens a PR
# that modifies code they own.
#
# Syntax: pattern owner1 owner2 ...
# Owners can be @username, @org/team-name, or email@example.com
#
# Order matters! Later rules override earlier ones.
# =============================================================================

